Reoteab

Reoteab is an unofficial community-maintained continuation of Coteab.
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Noteab or Coteab developers.

Project lineage: Noteab -> Coteab -> Reoteab

This baseline is derived from Coteab v2.2.0 (upstream commit
1db73aee188412eac7052f0e2e19c080dc670172), maintained by Vapure
(also identified upstream as xVapure, criticize., or C), Akito/Akitosama,
and other contributors. Coteab is based on Noteab.

The Apache License 2.0 and the original "Copyright 2025 Noteab" notice are
preserved in LICENSE. Reoteab's README, NOTICE, and repository-maintenance
files were added or changed for this continuation. No inherited runtime source
file was changed in this initial baseline.

The Coteab distribution also contained a document named
"Notice to people telling me I cannot update Noteab macro.txt". That document
was a general explanation of Apache 2.0 redistribution obligations, not an
attribution notice or a separate license. It is not reproduced here.

